{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-23","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"physics","number":23,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-mechanics","unitLabel":"역학","topic":"마찰·회전축·가속도","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-mechanics","physics-electro"],"stem":"그림과같이균일한원판A에감긴줄이동일한원판B에걸쳐서\n물체에연결되어있다. 물체가낙하운동을하면, A와B는각각\n원판의중심을지나는고정된회전축을중심으로회전한다. A, B의\n관성모멘트는서로같고, 줄은A, B에서미끄러지지않는다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은? (단,\nA, B는동일한연직면상에있고, 회전축과원판사이의마찰, 줄의\n질량, 공기저항은무시하며, 줄은팽팽하게유지되고, 중력가속도는\n이다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. 각가속도의크기는A와B가서로같다.\nㄴ. 회전축에대한돌림힘(토크)의크기는A와B가서로같다.\nㄷ. 물체의가속도는\n이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":268,"height":318,"region":0,"bbox":[110.056,93.148,107.2,127.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-23/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":18,"height":26,"region":0,"bbox":[14.856,293.548,7.2,10.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-23/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":772,"height":166,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,321.948,308.8,66.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-23/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[82.744,151.652,416.5,588.436],"width":333.756,"height":436.784,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[110.056,93.148,107.2,127.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","ass